          "jcr:created": "Tue Dec 19 2023 16:14:53 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">LUCAS device training center</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Theoretical and tools for hands-on training for the LUCAS device. Test your knowledge and receive a certificate.</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">This theoretical and tools for hands-on training course includes a robust offering of videos and instruction on the LUCAS chest compression system. Test your knowledge on how to operate the LUCAS device and receive a personalized certificate.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Sep 17 2025 13:43:59 GMT+0000",
